{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53180","headline":"诗偈 五 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出家舍烦恼，烦恼还同住。\n痴心觅福田，騃意承救度。\n十二因缘管，无繇免来去。\n依智不依识，依义不依语。\n佛心一子地，蠢动皆男女。\n平等如虚空，善恶俱无取。\n既不造天堂，谁受三涂苦。\n有无尽无余，乘空能自度。\n神作如来身，智作如来库。\n涌出波罗蜜，流通正道路。\n浑身加身佛，迷人自不悟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53180.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53180","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}